      "standardized_narrative": "The syndicate reported a prior year reserve release of $33.1 million in 2021, primarily driven by sizeable claims releases across the 2019 underwriting year. This occurred despite adverse impacts from the COVID-19 pandemic and natural catastrophes such as Hurricanes Laura, Sally, Delta, Zeta, Storm Dorian, Typhoons Faxai, Hagibis, and Derecho Weather in 2019 and 2020. A Loss Portfolio Transfer (LPT) in the Property division also contributed to a $9.0 million release. The Cyber & Executive Risk division also saw a net release despite increased ransomware claims activity.",
      "raw_causal_phrases": [
        "adversely impacted by some large claims attributable to the COVID-19 pandemic and natural catastrophes such as Hurricanes Laura, Sally, Delta and Zeta, Storm Dorian and Typhoons Faxai and Hagibis",
        "culminating in sizeable claims releases across the 2019 underwriting year",
        "adversely impacted by claims arising from the COVID-19 pandemic and natural catastrophes such as Hurricanes Laura, Zeta, Delta and Derecho Weather",
        "released prior year reserves of $33.1m",
        "Marine, Property and Specialty Lines divisions all produced large releases on the 2019 underwriting year",
        "Cyber & Executive Risk produced a net release of $4.4m despite an increase in ransomware claims activity on the 2020 underwriting year",
        "action in the Property division to remediate selected areas of the account, including the entering into a 90% Loss Portfolio Transfer (LPT) of the divisions Engineering classes in March 2021, contributing to the release of $9.0m in the division"
      ],
